   $q$Listen. To bake a birthday cake, Dad and Kiri mix flour, sugar, eggs and butter in a big bowl. They pour the batter into a pan and bake it in a hot oven. Next, they wait for the cake to cool all the way, because frosting melts and slides off a warm cake. Last, they spread on the frosting and add the candles. Why do they wait for the cake to cool? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"so frosting stays on","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"so frosting stays on"}},{"text":"so it gets hot","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"so it gets hot"}},{"text":"so it bakes more","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"so it bakes more"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$so frosting stays on$q$, $q$Frosting melts and slides off a warm cake. So they wait for the cake to cool, and then the frosting stays on.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
