   $q$Listen. Kim's class makes butter from cream. They pour thick cream into a jar and close the lid tight. Then the children take turns shaking the jar hard for a long, long time. At first, the cream gets thick and fluffy, like whipped cream. If they keep on shaking, a lump of yellow butter forms, with thin liquid all around it. What must they do to turn the cream into butter? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"shake the jar","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"shake the jar"}},{"text":"freeze the jar","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"freeze the jar"}},{"text":"paint the jar","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"paint the jar"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$shake the jar$q$, $q$The children shake the jar of cream for a long time. First it gets thick and fluffy, and then a lump of butter forms.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
