   $q$Listen. Farmer Lee gave a little hen named Dot a new nest, but Dot clucked, It is too small. Next, Farmer Lee gave Dot a warm straw bed, and Dot clucked, It is too scratchy. Then the cold snow came, and Dot snuggled into the little nest on the warm straw. Dot felt so cozy that Dot gave Farmer Lee the biggest egg of all. What is the lesson of this story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Keep trying","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Keep trying"}},{"text":"Be thankful","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Be thankful"}},{"text":"Slow and steady wins","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Slow and steady wins"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Be thankful$q$, $q$Dot complained about the gifts at first. When the snow came, Dot saw how good they were and gave Farmer Lee a big egg. The lesson is be thankful.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
