   $q$Listen. Mama Duck told the ducklings, Stay close to the shore, because the middle of the pond is too deep. Most of the ducklings stayed by the grass. But one duckling, Puddle, paddled out to the middle anyway. A strong wind pushed Puddle far away, and Puddle could not paddle back. Mama Duck swam out to bring Puddle home, and after that, Puddle stayed near the shore. What is the lesson of this story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Do not brag","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Do not brag"}},{"text":"Listen to grownups","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Listen to grownups"}},{"text":"Share with friends","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Share with friends"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Listen to grownups$q$, $q$Mama Duck said to stay near the shore. Puddle did not, and Puddle got stuck far away. The lesson is listen to grownups.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
