   $q$Listen. Goat found a field of sweet clover and kept it a secret from the other goats. Goat ate and ate, much more than any goat needed. Soon Goat's tummy was so round that Goat could not squeeze back through the gate to get home. Goat had to wait outside in the cold all night. The next time, Goat ate just enough. What is the lesson of this story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Do not be greedy","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Do not be greedy"}},{"text":"Plan ahead","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Plan ahead"}},{"text":"Be brave","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Be brave"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Do not be greedy$q$, $q$Goat ate much more than needed and got stuck outside all night. Next time, Goat ate just enough. The lesson is do not be greedy.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
