   $q$Listen. Frog wished it could sing like Bird. Frog tried to whistle, but only a croak came out, and Frog felt silly. Then Frog tried to fly like Bird and landed with a plop in the mud. That night, the pond was quiet and still. Frog sang a big, deep croak, and all the frogs joined in to make the best song of the night. What is the lesson of this story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Do not be greedy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Do not be greedy"}},{"text":"Be yourself","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Be yourself"}},{"text":"Plan ahead","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Plan ahead"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Be yourself$q$, $q$Frog could not sing or fly like Bird. But when Frog croaked like a frog, it made the best song of the night. The lesson is be yourself.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
