   $q$Listen. A small kitten named Miso was afraid of the big dog next door. One day, Miso's ball rolled under the fence into the dog's yard. Miso's paws shook, but Miso crept through the gap to get the ball anyway. The dog sniffed Miso, wagged its tail, and nudged the ball back. Now Miso and the dog nap in the sun together. What is the lesson of this story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Do not brag","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Do not brag"}},{"text":"Tell the truth","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Tell the truth"}},{"text":"Be brave","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Be brave"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Be brave$q$, $q$Miso was scared but went into the yard anyway, and the dog turned out to be friendly. The lesson is be brave.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
