   $q$Listen. The farm animals could not find Hen's lost key. Cow looked all over the barn, and Horse looked across the field, but the key was gone. Then tiny Mouse said, I can look in small places. Mouse squeezed under the fence and into a crack in the wall and came back holding the key. Everyone cheered for the smallest friend on the farm. What is the lesson of this story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Be patient","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Be patient"}},{"text":"Tell the truth","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Tell the truth"}},{"text":"Little ones can help","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Little ones can help"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Little ones can help$q$, $q$The big animals could not find the key, but tiny Mouse fit into small places and found it. The lesson is little ones can help.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
