insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('0339b23f-cd0f-5797-ac3c-9eabfd5d3500', 'rg3-authors-purpose-p02', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g3-authors-purpose'), null,
        '3-5', $q$We Need a Longer Recess$q$, $q$At my school, recess lasts only fifteen minutes. By the time we line up and walk outside, we get about ten minutes to play. I think recess should be thirty minutes long.

First, children need to move their bodies. Sitting at a desk all morning makes my legs feel restless. Running, jumping and climbing help us stay healthy and strong.

Second, a longer recess would help us learn. After I play outside, I can pay attention much better. My friends say the same thing. Our brains need a break, just like our legs do.

Third, recess teaches us to get along. On the playground, we take turns, make up games and solve small problems with our friends. These are skills we use every day.

Some people say a longer recess would take away time from reading and math. But students who are rested and calm can learn more in less time. Please ask our principal to make recess thirty minutes long. Every student would be glad you did.$q$, 'draft')
