   $q$Priya believes that a short recess is fine because class time is more important. How is Priya's view different from the author's view?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The author thinks students should skip reading and math.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-claim"},{"text":"The author thinks a longer break helps students learn more in class time.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The author thinks recess should stay fifteen minutes long.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-opinion"},{"text":"The author agrees that class time matters more than recess.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-author-view"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The author thinks a longer break helps students learn more in class time.$q$, $q$The author answers this view by saying rested, calm students "can learn more in less time," so a longer recess helps learning. The author never says to skip reading or math.$q$, 'draft', '0339b23f-cd0f-5797-ac3c-9eabfd5d3500')
