  ('6292a66f-add9-544c-81fe-f6418a349348', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g3-authors-purpose'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Lena says, "I would rather play soccer than learn an instrument." How would the author most likely answer Lena?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Only kids who are already good at music should play.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"Try an instrument anyway, because it is fun and teaches patience.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Music is fine, but only the piano is worth learning.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Soccer is a better choice than music for most kids.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-author-view"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Try an instrument anyway, because it is fun and teaches patience.$q$, $q$The author believes every child should try an instrument and says it is fun and teaches patience. The author says any instrument "is a great place to start," so the piano is not the only choice.$q$, 'draft', '2a906249-aa56-518e-a31e-aa2d46c45d63')
