values ('3f0fe01d-14b8-5ae4-ae86-f7d03b238798', 'rg3-comparing-texts-p02', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g3-comparing-texts'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Jamal, Priya and the Hornets$q$, $q$The same author wrote a story and a poem about the same soccer team.

Text 1: The Missed Kick

Jamal ran toward the goal with the ball. The whole field seemed to hold its breath. Jamal kicked hard, but the ball sailed over the net. Jamal stared down at the grass. Then Priya jogged over. "Good try! We will get the next one," Priya said. The rest of the Hornets clapped. In the second half, Jamal passed the ball to Priya, and Priya scored. The team cheered together, and Jamal cheered loudest of all.

Text 2: Hornets on the Field

Jamal passes, Priya runs,
Green grass shining in the sun.
One kick misses, that's okay,
Friends will help us find a way.

Pass it left and pass it right,
Together we are strong and bright.
Win or lose, we play as one.
Hornets always have such fun!$q$, 'draft')
