   $q$"The minutes crawled by." What does this sentence mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The kitchen clock had stopped working.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The time seemed to go by very fast.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"Something was crawling across the floor.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"The time seemed to go by very slowly.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The time seemed to go by very slowly.$q$, $q$Ama is waiting and watching the clock, and crawling is a slow way to move, so the minutes felt slow. Nothing in the story is really crawling.$q$, 'draft', 'd860f7a9-40c6-5fd3-9fa1-b6e6bbdc3d95')
