   $q$At the end, "Ama grinned from ear to ear." What does this tell you?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Ama touched one ear and then the other.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"Ama listened closely to Grandpa's words.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-meaning"},{"text":"Ama smiled a very big, happy smile.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Ama frowned because the bread was hot.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Ama smiled a very big, happy smile.$q$, $q$Grandpa has just praised Ama's work, and a grin so wide it seems to reach both ears is a huge smile. Ama is not touching or using the ears at all.$q$, 'draft', 'd860f7a9-40c6-5fd3-9fa1-b6e6bbdc3d95')
