  ('858c6dd2-0ca1-5e53-ab86-13c9140d1319', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g3-literary-structure-pov'), null, 'hard',
   $q$A reader thinks Mateo was trying to help from the very start. How does this reader's view compare with the narrator's view in Chapter 1?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They are different, because the narrator saw Mateo's work as ruining the plan.","is_correct":true},{"text":"They are the same, because the narrator wanted bottle caps too.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"They are different, because the narrator never noticed what Mateo did.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"They are the same, because the narrator thanks Mateo right away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-part"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They are different, because the narrator saw Mateo's work as ruining the plan.$q$, $q$In Chapter 1 the narrator says Mateo is "ruining everything," which is a different view from a reader who sees Mateo as helpful. The narrator only says thanks at the end of Chapter 2, not in Chapter 1.$q$, 'draft', '25adaad8-da1f-55ae-b51c-53f6f87285fb')
